# One-time changes to an existing install's .env, for when .env.production renames, drops or must change a setting.
# install.sh applies each line newer than MOVIEBROWSER3_ENV_MIGRATION (saved in .env) once, in order. A new install
# starts from .env.production and skips them all. Never edit or renumber a line once it's on main; add a new one.
#
#   <number> rename OLD_KEY NEW_KEY   keep the saved value under the new name (if both exist, OLD_KEY is dropped)
#   <number> remove KEY               drop a setting that's gone
#   <number> set KEY value            overwrite a saved value, e.g. when a default must change on existing installs
#
# Change .env.production in the same commit, so new installs get the same result.
#
# Keys that .env.production adds don't need a line: every run adds missing keys with their defaults.

1 set VLC_TRACK_INTERVAL_SECONDS 5
